@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "Finance / Admin" as P0
participant "PaymentGateway" as P1
participant "Store transisi PO" as P2
participant "Firestore" as P3
P0 -> P1: Pilih kanal pembayaran demo
P1 -> P1: Gunakan total PO tersimpan
P0 -> P1: Konfirmasi simulasi
P1 -> P2: onPaymentSuccess(tx)
P2 -> P3: Baca PO dalam transaksi
P3 --> P2: PO dan verifikasi GRN
P2 -> P2: Cek role, match, total
P2 -> P3: Simpan paymentInfo + Selesai
P3 --> P2: Commit berhasil
P2 --> P1: Pembayaran tercatat
P1 --> P0: Bukti simulasi tersedia
@enduml